-- **schema**: `andamentum.experiment.docstore_deferred.http_ledger/1`
-- **produced by**: `every measurement rule (one ledger per arm)`
-- **required keys**: (none)
-- **format**: JSONL, one object per httpx request, appended in completion order
-
-Every HTTP request the recording process made, with in-flight depth at start. H-a1 (defer is LLM-free) is the emptiness of one of these files.
-
-| field | type | units | meaning |
-|---|---|---|---|
-| `ts_start / ts_end` | float | s since epoch | request start / completion |
-| `method` | string | - | HTTP method |
-| `host` | string | - | netloc; '11434' identifies Ollama |
-| `path` | string | - | /v1/chat/completions | /api/embeddings | /api/embed |
-| `global_depth_at_start` | int | count | requests open across ALL endpoints when this one started — an upper bound on any single endpoint, never an attribution |
-| `in_flight_at_start_path` | int | count | requests open ON THIS PATH when this one started — the per-endpoint concurrency figure |
-| `status` | int|null | - | HTTP status, or null if the request raised |
-| `error_type` | string|null | - | exception class name on failure |
-
-## `results/snapshots/*.json`
