-| field | type | units | meaning |
-|---|---|---|---|
-| `label` | string | - | which drain and which side (pre / post) |
-| `logical_fingerprint` | hex string | - | sha256 over the MEANING of every row (uuid|status|file_hash|markdown_len|n_chunks|has_doc_embedding|n_chunk_embeddings|metadata_keys). The file hash is not used: WAL checkpoints move bytes without changing meaning |
-| `status_counts` | object | counts | pending_source / pending_enrich / complete / failed |
-| `documents[].ingest_status` | string | - | the row's queue state |
-| `documents[].markdown_sha256` | hex string | - | H-c2's byte-identity check |
-| `documents[].n_chunks` | int | count | chunk rows written by enrichment |
-| `documents[].n_chunk_embeddings` | int | count | must equal n_chunks when complete |
-| `documents[].llm_metadata_populated` | bool | - | the H-G failure's persistent trace |
-| `file_advisory` | object | - | byte-level facts, ADVISORY — nothing asserts on them |
